<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Cwithdraw</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cwithdraw &lt;amount&gt; &lt;money&gt;
cwithdraw all &lt;money&gt;
</pre>
<p>Examples:
</p>
<pre>cwithdraw 5 gold
cwithdraw 20 sp
cwithdraw all gold
</pre>
<p>Takes money out of your clan's treasury into your purse. Name the coins: 
iron, copper, silver, gold or platinum, or ip, cp, sp, gp, pp for short. 
With all, you take as much of the treasury as comes out in whole coins of 
that kind. 
Only the clan Master and the members appointed treasurer can withdraw 
(see <a cmd='#'>Help Clan Treasurer</a>), and only at the clan chest in the clan house. 
To see how much there is, use <a cmd='#'>Help Cbalance</a>.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cdeposit</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cbalance</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Clan Treasurer</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Clan Commands</a>
</pre>




</div>